{"id":5768,"date":"2021-01-19T11:07:50","date_gmt":"2021-01-19T10:07:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=5768"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:02:42","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:02:42","slug":"qui-doit-deneiger-le-trottoir-devant-chez-vous","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/qui-doit-deneiger-le-trottoir-devant-chez-vous\/","title":{"rendered":"Qui doit d\u00e9neiger le trottoir devant chez vous ?"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"text-zoom\">\n<div id=\"actualite\" class=\"lead\">\n<p><strong>Alors qu&rsquo;un \u00e9pisode neigeux traverse une partie du territoire, vous vous posez peut-\u00eatre la question de savoir si vous devez, en tant que riverain, d\u00e9neiger le trottoir situ\u00e9 devant chez vous.\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/I4318.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5770\" src=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/I4318.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"235\" height=\"156\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/I4318.png 235w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/I4318-166x110.png 166w, https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/I4318-200x133.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 235px) 100vw, 235px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p>Un arr\u00eat\u00e9 \u00e0 Hoenheim pr\u00e9voit que le d\u00e9neigement consiste pour les riverains (locataire, propri\u00e9taire, syndic) \u00e0 d\u00e9blayer la neige mais aussi \u00e0 saler ou sabler en cas de verglas. Cette op\u00e9ration s&rsquo;effectue jusqu&rsquo;\u00e0 la limite du trottoir avec la voirie.<\/p>\n<div id=\"fiche-item-4situation2\" class=\"fiche-item-content collapse in\">\n<p>Dans le cas o\u00f9 les mesures impos\u00e9es par l&rsquo;arr\u00eat\u00e9 municipal n&rsquo;ont pas \u00e9t\u00e9 prises, la victime peut engager la responsabilit\u00e9 :<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>du locataire ou du propri\u00e9taire si le trottoir jouxte une maison individuelle ;<\/li>\n<li>du syndicat des copropri\u00e9taires et\/ou du syndic de copropri\u00e9t\u00e9 si le trottoir jouxte un immeuble en copropri\u00e9t\u00e9.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<hr \/>\n<p>Source : <a href=\"https:\/\/www.service-public.fr\/particuliers\/actualites\/A14569\"><span class=\"expression\"><em>Service-Public.fr<\/em><\/span> <\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Alors qu&rsquo;un \u00e9pisode neigeux traverse une partie du territoire, vous vous posez peut-\u00eatre la question de savoir si vous devez, en tant que riverain, d\u00e9neiger le trottoir situ\u00e9 devant chez vous.\u00a0<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[31,1,42],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5768"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5768"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5768\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5771,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5768\/revisions\/5771"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=5768"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=5768"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=5768"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}